# Trivy ignore file — documented, justified vulnerability exceptions only.
#
# Each entry MUST carry a justification comment and (ideally) a review date.
# Format: one CVE id per line, e.g.
#   CVE-2024-12345  # transitive via foo; no fix available, not reachable in our code paths — review 2026-09
#
# Empty by default: the HIGH/CRITICAL gate is strict. Add an entry ONLY when a
# finding is genuinely unfixable/not-applicable, never to silence the gate.
